{"seq":2,"slug":"mvi-redux-mobile","title":"MVI 与 Redux 移动端实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns/mvi-redux-mobile","wordCount":1033,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"mvi-与-redux-移动端实现\">MVI 与 Redux 移动端实现</h1><p>Model-View-Intent（MVI）是单向数据流在 Android/Kotlin 生态的主流落地形式。它借鉴了 Web 前端 Redux 的 Store-Action-Reducer 三件套，但针对移动端的生命周期、协程并发、Compose 重组机制做了适配。在 2026 年的 Android 开发中，MVI 已经从&quot;实验性方案&quot;变成了 Jetpack Compose 场景下的事实推荐——Google 官方 Architecture Guide 将其称为&quot;ViewModel + UiState + Events&quot;模式，本质就是 MVI 去掉了名字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>单一 UiState</strong>：屏幕状态是一个不可变 data class，任何时刻都是完整快照，消除多 Flow 更新顺序不确定带来的中间态</li>\n<li><strong>sealed Intent/Event</strong>：用户操作和系统事件枚举为 sealed interface，Reducer 通过 when 匹配处理</li>\n<li><strong>State vs Effect 分离</strong>：持续状态（StateFlow）与一次性副作用（Channel）使用不同机制存储和消费</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"三要素定义\">三要素定义</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>Kotlin 表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Model</strong></td>\n<td>屏幕的完整 UI 状态（单一不可变对象）</td>\n<td><code>data class UiState(...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>View</strong></td>\n<td>订阅 State、发送 Intent</td>\n<td><code>@Composable</code> 函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Intent</strong></td>\n<td>用户操作或系统事件的枚举</td>\n<td><code>sealed interface UiEvent</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>与 MVVM 的核心差异在于<strong>状态的原子性</strong>：MVVM 可能用多个 StateFlow 表达一个屏幕的不同方面（<code>isLoading</code>、<code>items</code>、<code>error</code>），MVI 将它们合并为一个 <code>UiState</code> 对象——任何时刻屏幕状态是一个<strong>快照</strong>，不存在中间态。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>render</mtext><mo>:</mo><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>U</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{render}: UiState \\rightarrow UI</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">render</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>reduce</mtext><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{reduce}: (UiState, UiEvent) \\rightarrow (UiState, [SideEffect])</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reduce</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"完整实现模板\">完整实现模板</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 1. 状态定义&#10;data class ProductListState(&#10;    val products: List&lt;Product&gt; = emptyList(),&#10;    val isLoading: Boolean = false,&#10;    val error: String? = null,&#10;    val searchQuery: String = &quot;&quot;&#10;) {&#10;    // 派生状态用 computed property&#10;    val filteredProducts: List&lt;Product&gt;&#10;        get() = if (searchQuery.isBlank()) products&#10;                else products.filter { it.name.contains(searchQuery, ignoreCase = true) }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 2. Intent 定义&#10;sealed interface ProductListEvent {&#10;    data object LoadProducts : ProductListEvent&#10;    data class SearchQueryChanged(val query: String) : ProductListEvent&#10;    data class ProductClicked(val id: String) : ProductListEvent&#10;    data object RetryClicked : ProductListEvent&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 3. 一次性副作用（导航、Toast 等）&#10;sealed interface ProductListEffect {&#10;    data class NavigateToDetail(val productId: String) : ProductListEffect&#10;    data class ShowToast(val message: String) : ProductListEffect&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 4. ViewModel 作为 Store&#10;class ProductListViewModel(&#10;    private val getProductsUseCase: GetProductsUseCase&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    private val _state = MutableStateFlow(ProductListState())&#10;    val state: StateFlow&lt;ProductListState&gt; = _state.asStateFlow()&#10;&#10;    private val _effects = Channel&lt;ProductListEffect&gt;(Channel.BUFFERED)&#10;    val effects: Flow&lt;ProductListEffect&gt; = _effects.receiveAsFlow()&#10;&#10;    fun onEvent(event: ProductListEvent) {&#10;        when (event) {&#10;            is ProductListEvent.LoadProducts -&gt; loadProducts()&#10;            is ProductListEvent.SearchQueryChanged -&gt; {&#10;                _state.update { it.copy(searchQuery = event.query) }&#10;            }&#10;            is ProductListEvent.ProductClicked -&gt; {&#10;                viewModelScope.launch {&#10;                    _effects.send(ProductListEffect.NavigateToDetail(event.id))&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;            is ProductListEvent.RetryClicked -&gt; loadProducts()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private fun loadProducts() {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch {&#10;            _state.update { it.copy(isLoading = true, error = null) }&#10;            getProductsUseCase()&#10;                .onSuccess { products -&gt;&#10;                    _state.update { it.copy(isLoading = false, products = products) }&#10;                }&#10;                .onFailure { e -&gt;&#10;                    _state.update { it.copy(isLoading = false, error = e.message) }&#10;                }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 1. 状态定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class ProductListState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val products: List&#x3C;Product> = emptyList(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val isLoading: Boolean = false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val error: String? = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val searchQuery: String = \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 派生状态用 computed property</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val filteredProducts: List&#x3C;Product></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        get() = if (searchQuery.isBlank()) products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                else products.filter { it.name.contains(searchQuery, ignoreCase = true) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 2. Intent 定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed interface ProductListEvent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data object LoadProducts : ProductListEvent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class SearchQueryChanged(val query: String) : ProductListEvent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class ProductClicked(val id: String) : ProductListEvent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data object RetryClicked : ProductListEvent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 3. 一次性副作用（导航、Toast 等）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed interface ProductListEffect {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class NavigateToDetail(val productId: String) : ProductListEffect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class ShowToast(val message: String) : ProductListEffect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 4. ViewModel 作为 Store</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ProductListViewModel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val getProductsUseCase: GetProductsUseCase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val _state = MutableStateFlow(ProductListState())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val state: StateFlow&#x3C;ProductListState> = _state.asStateFlow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val _effects = Channel&#x3C;ProductListEffect>(Channel.BUFFERED)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val effects: Flow&#x3C;ProductListEffect> = _effects.receiveAsFlow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun onEvent(event: ProductListEvent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        when (event) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is ProductListEvent.LoadProducts -> loadProducts()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is ProductListEvent.SearchQueryChanged -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                _state.update { it.copy(searchQuery = event.query) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is ProductListEvent.ProductClicked -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    _effects.send(ProductListEffect.NavigateToDetail(event.id))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is ProductListEvent.RetryClicked -> loadProducts()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private fun loadProducts() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _state.update { it.copy(isLoading = true, error = null) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            getProductsUseCase()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .onSuccess { products -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    _state.update { it.copy(isLoading = false, products = products) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .onFailure { e -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    _state.update { it.copy(isLoading = false, error = e.message) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"state-vs-effect-区分-持续状态-与-一次性事件\">State vs Effect：区分&quot;持续状态&quot;与&quot;一次性事件&quot;</h2><p>MVI 的一个关键设计决策是区分 <strong>State</strong>（持续存在、配置变更后恢复）和 <strong>Effect</strong>（消费一次即丢弃、不参与重组）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    E[UiEvent] --&gt; VM[ViewModel]&#10;    VM --&gt;|持续状态| S[StateFlow&amp;lt;UiState&amp;gt;]&#10;    VM --&gt;|一次性副作用| EF[Channel&amp;lt;Effect&amp;gt;]&#10;    S --&gt;|collectAsState| UI[Compose UI]&#10;    EF --&gt;|LaunchedEffect collect| NAV[导航/Toast/Dialog]\">flowchart TD\n    E[UiEvent] --&gt; VM[ViewModel]\n    VM --&gt;|持续状态| S[StateFlow&amp;lt;UiState&amp;gt;]\n    VM --&gt;|一次性副作用| EF[Channel&amp;lt;Effect&amp;gt;]\n    S --&gt;|collectAsState| UI[Compose UI]\n    EF --&gt;|LaunchedEffect collect| NAV[导航/Toast/Dialog]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>存储机制</th>\n<th>配置变更后</th>\n<th>消费方式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>State</td>\n<td><code>StateFlow</code></td>\n<td>自动恢复（ViewModel 存活）</td>\n<td><code>collectAsState()</code> 驱动重组</td>\n<td>列表数据、加载状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Effect</td>\n<td><code>Channel</code></td>\n<td>不重复消费</td>\n<td><code>LaunchedEffect</code> 一次性收集</td>\n<td>导航跳转、Snackbar</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>将导航放入 State 是一个常见错误——它会导致配置变更（屏幕旋转）后重复导航。</p>\n<h2 id=\"reducer-的纯函数提取\">Reducer 的纯函数提取</h2><p>当 ViewModel 的 <code>onEvent</code> 方法膨胀时，将 Reduce 逻辑提取为纯函数可以大幅提升可测试性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 纯函数 Reducer —— 可独立单元测试&#10;object ProductListReducer {&#10;    fun reduce(&#10;        state: ProductListState,&#10;        result: ProductListResult&#10;    ): ProductListState = when (result) {&#10;        is ProductListResult.Loading -&gt; state.copy(isLoading = true, error = null)&#10;        is ProductListResult.Success -&gt; state.copy(isLoading = false, products = result.products)&#10;        is ProductListResult.Error -&gt; state.copy(isLoading = false, error = result.message)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 测试&#10;@Test&#10;fun `reduce Loading sets isLoading true`() {&#10;    val initial = ProductListState()&#10;    val next = ProductListReducer.reduce(initial, ProductListResult.Loading)&#10;    assertEquals(true, next.isLoading)&#10;    assertEquals(null, next.error)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 纯函数 Reducer —— 可独立单元测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object ProductListReducer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun reduce(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        state: ProductListState,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        result: ProductListResult</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ): ProductListState = when (result) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        is ProductListResult.Loading -> state.copy(isLoading = true, error = null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        is ProductListResult.Success -> state.copy(isLoading = false, products = result.products)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        is ProductListResult.Error -> state.copy(isLoading = false, error = result.message)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun `reduce Loading sets isLoading true`() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val initial = ProductListState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val next = ProductListReducer.reduce(initial, ProductListResult.Loading)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assertEquals(true, next.isLoading)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assertEquals(null, next.error)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与-redux-的对应关系\">与 Redux 的对应关系</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Redux 概念</th>\n<th>MVI 对应</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Store</td>\n<td>ViewModel</td>\n<td>持有 State、分发 Action</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Action</td>\n<td>Intent / UiEvent</td>\n<td>描述&quot;发生了什么&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reducer</td>\n<td>reduce 函数</td>\n<td>纯状态转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Middleware</td>\n<td>Effect Handler</td>\n<td>副作用执行（网络/数据库）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Selector</td>\n<td>State computed property</td>\n<td>派生状态（避免 UI 端计算）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>combineReducers</td>\n<td>多个 Reducer 组合</td>\n<td>分治大状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Redux 的 <code>combineReducers</code> 在移动端表现为将大 State 拆分为子 State，每个子 State 由独立 Reducer 处理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⊕</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⊕</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">State_{app} = State_{home} \\oplus State_{search} \\oplus State_{cart}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pp</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">reduce_{app}(s, a) = (reduce_{home}(s.home, a),\\; reduce_{search}(s.search, a),\\; reduce_{cart}(s.cart, a))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pp</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"compose-ui-端接入\">Compose UI 端接入</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun ProductListScreen(viewModel: ProductListViewModel = hiltViewModel()) {&#10;    val state by viewModel.state.collectAsState()&#10;&#10;    // 一次性副作用收集&#10;    LaunchedEffect(Unit) {&#10;        viewModel.effects.collect { effect -&gt;&#10;            when (effect) {&#10;                is ProductListEffect.NavigateToDetail -&gt; navController.navigate(&quot;product/${effect.productId}&quot;)&#10;                is ProductListEffect.ShowToast -&gt; snackbarHost.showSnackbar(effect.message)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 纯渲染：State → UI&#10;    when {&#10;        state.isLoading -&gt; LoadingIndicator()&#10;        state.error != null -&gt; ErrorView(&#10;            message = state.error!!,&#10;            onRetry = { viewModel.onEvent(ProductListEvent.RetryClicked) }&#10;        )&#10;        else -&gt; ProductList(&#10;            products = state.filteredProducts,&#10;            onProductClick = { viewModel.onEvent(ProductListEvent.ProductClicked(it.id)) }&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ProductListScreen(viewModel: ProductListViewModel = hiltViewModel()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val state by viewModel.state.collectAsState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 一次性副作用收集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LaunchedEffect(Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel.effects.collect { effect -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            when (effect) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                is ProductListEffect.NavigateToDetail -> navController.navigate(\"product/${effect.productId}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                is ProductListEffect.ShowToast -> snackbarHost.showSnackbar(effect.message)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 纯渲染：State → UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    when {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        state.isLoading -> LoadingIndicator()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        state.error != null -> ErrorView(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            message = state.error!!,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onRetry = { viewModel.onEvent(ProductListEvent.RetryClicked) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else -> ProductList(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            products = state.filteredProducts,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onProductClick = { viewModel.onEvent(ProductListEvent.ProductClicked(it.id)) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"性能考量-state-粒度与重组优化\">性能考量：State 粒度与重组优化</h2><p>单一 State 对象的一个潜在问题是<strong>过度重组</strong>：任何字段变化都会触发 <code>collectAsState</code> 返回新值，导致整个 Composable 树重新评估。优化策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><code>distinctUntilChanged</code> + 精确订阅</strong>：在 Composable 内部只 collect 需要的子状态</li>\n<li><strong><code>@Stable</code> 注解</strong>：告诉 Compose 编译器对象稳定性保证</li>\n<li><strong>State 拆分</strong>：极端情况下将高频变化字段（如动画进度）从主 State 分离</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 精确订阅避免过度重组&#10;val isLoading by remember { viewModel.state.map { it.isLoading }.distinctUntilChanged() }&#10;    .collectAsState(initial = false)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 精确订阅避免过度重组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val isLoading by remember { viewModel.state.map { it.isLoading }.distinctUntilChanged() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .collectAsState(initial = false)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MVI 的状态机模型与 <a href=\"composable-architecture\">可组合架构</a> 在设计哲学上同源——都追求单一状态、纯 Reducer、受控副作用。差异在于 TCA 通过 Swift 类型系统在编译期保证组合正确性，而 MVI 在 Kotlin 中更依赖约定。选择哪一个取决于你的目标平台和团队对类型安全的要求程度。若要在一个代码库中同时服务 iOS 和 Android，<a href=\"modularization-strategies\">模块化策略</a> 提供了如何在 KMP 共享层复用 Reducer 逻辑的方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>MVI 是单向数据流在 Kotlin/Android 生态的标准实现。它的核心价值是将屏幕状态从&quot;多个独立的可变流&quot;收敛为&quot;一个不可变快照&quot;——这使得状态可序列化、可快照测试、可调试。State 与 Effect 的分离解决了&quot;配置变更后重复消费一次性事件&quot;这个移动端特有的经典 Bug。在 Jetpack Compose 时代，MVI 已经从&quot;可选的高级模式&quot;变成了 Google 推荐实践的默认形态。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MVI 与 Redux 移动端实现","id":"mvi-与-redux-移动端实现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三要素定义","id":"三要素定义"},{"level":2,"text":"完整实现模板","id":"完整实现模板"},{"level":2,"text":"State vs Effect：区分\"持续状态\"与\"一次性事件\"","id":"state-vs-effect-区分-持续状态-与-一次性事件"},{"level":2,"text":"Reducer 的纯函数提取","id":"reducer-的纯函数提取"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Redux 的对应关系","id":"与-redux-的对应关系"},{"level":2,"text":"Compose UI 端接入","id":"compose-ui-端接入"},{"level":2,"text":"性能考量：State 粒度与重组优化","id":"性能考量-state-粒度与重组优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可组合架构（TCA / Composable Architecture）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns/composable-architecture"},"next":{"title":"模块化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/modern-patterns/modularization-strategies"}}